ORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"24\" valign=\"center\" width=\"115\"><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※등록금 범위 : 입학금, 수업료, 기성회비</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 국가 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">Ⅱ</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">유형 장학금 + 교내 스마일(가계곤란)장학금</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 소득5분위 이하</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 학생들에게 교내 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">스마일장학금 또는 국가장학금 Ⅱ유형 지급</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가장학금 Ⅰ유형 선발자 중에서 다자녀, 기혼자, 장애인, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">한국대학생지식봉사(교육기부) 지원금 수혜자, 저소득 성적우수 학생은 10월경에 추가 선발하여 국가장학금 Ⅱ유형 지급 예정 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">장학금은 등록금 범위내에서 중복하여 지급 가능</span></span></font></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 소득분위별 장학금액(국가 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">Ⅰ.Ⅱ</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">, 교내스마일) 결정</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;- 국가장학금Ⅰ유형+국가장학금Ⅱ유형+스마일장학금 총액으로 확인</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가장학금 및 교내 스마일장학금 지급액은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">소득분위가 낮을수록 더 많은 혜택</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이 주어지도록 &nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">소득분위별(기초생활수급자~8분위)로 차등</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지급</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 안내사항</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">개인별 장학금액은 개인정보이므로 전화로 알려드리지 않습니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; * 장학금 내역은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">등록금고지서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">및</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스-학생지원-장학금/대출금에서 확인</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가장학생으로 선발완료된 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013-2학기 복학생 중에서 휴학당시 등록금을 내고 복학</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">10월중에 국가장학금을 학생계좌로 입금</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">할 예정이므로 문자수신후 원스톱서비스-장학내역에서 장학금액을 확인(장학금 지급 시 학생 및 학부모님께 문자 발송예정)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2차 국가장학생 선발(10월경) 및 장학금 지급 안내는 추후 학사안내 공지예정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br><font size=\"5\" face=\"HY울릉도M\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>금오공대 학생처</font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
